1
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:14,570
(Sheldon:)Clarify something for me.

2
00:00:14,570 --> 00:00:15,600
(Sheldon:)Isn't the point

3
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:17,670
(Sheldon:)of a communal meal

4
00:00:17,670 --> 00:00:20,300
(Sheldon:)the exchange of ideas
and opinions?

5
00:00:20,310 --> 00:00:23,040
(Sheldon:)An opportunity to consider
important issues of the day?

6
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:24,380
(Leonard:)It is.

7
00:00:24,380 --> 00:00:26,240
(Leonard:)You just kind of put
a damper on things

8
00:00:26,240 --> 00:00:27,880
(Leonard:)when you said,
"The next person I see talking

9
00:00:27,880 --> 00:00:30,450
(Leonard:)with food in their mouth
will be put to death."

10
00:00:30,450 --> 00:00:33,720
(Sheldon:)Well, we could argue about
who said what all night long,

11
00:00:33,720 --> 00:00:36,520
(Sheldon:)but to set things back
on course,

12
00:00:36,520 --> 00:00:38,860
(Sheldon:)I will propose
a new topic of conversation.

13
00:00:39,890 --> 00:00:40,890
(Leonard:)Great.

14
00:00:40,890 --> 00:00:42,960
(Sheldon:)What is the best number?

15
00:00:42,960 --> 00:00:46,760
(Sheldon:)By the way, there's only
one correct answer.

16
00:00:46,770 --> 00:00:50,570
5,318,008?

17
00:00:50,570 --> 00:00:51,770
(Sheldon:)Wrong.

18
00:00:52,640 --> 00:00:55,910
(Sheldon:)The best number is 73.

19
00:00:58,080 --> 00:01:00,210
(Sheldon:)You're probably wondering why.

20
00:01:00,210 --> 00:01:01,710
(Raj:)No. Uh-uh.
We're good.

